  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Hierdie veld word vereis.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSATitle:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Voeg nou sekuriteitsvrae by
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSALeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Net in geval jy jou wagwoord vergeet, kies 3 sekuriteitsvrae. Maak seker jou antwoorde is maklik om te onthou.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSAErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: You’ll need to finish entering your security questions before you can continue.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Third one's a charm. Choose your last question, type the answer, and you're good to go.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Now for the second one. Same drill.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Now you can set up 3 security questions to help you reset your password if you forget it. Choose the first question and type your answer.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder3:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Sekuriteitsvraag (3 van 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder2:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Sekuriteitsvraag (2 van 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder1:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Sekuriteitsvraag (1 van 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion6:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat is die naam van die eerste skool wat jy bygewoon het?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion5:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat is die voornaam van jou oudste neef?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion4:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat is die naam van die stad waar jou ouers ontmoet het?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion3:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat was jou bynaam as kind?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion2:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat is die naam van die stad waar jy gebore is?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion1:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wat was jou eerste troeteldier se naam?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityAnswerPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Jou antwoord
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Ok, now type a password for your account.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordTitle:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Kies ’n uiters onvergeetlike wagwoord
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordReqErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Looks like you didn't meet all the password requirements. Let's try this again.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPolicy_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Die wagwoord wat jy ingetik het, voldoen nie aan die kompleksiteitsvereistes vir wagwoorde wat deur die administrateur vir jou netwerk of groep gestel is nie. Kry die vereistes by jou administrateur en tik dan ’n nuwe wagwoord in.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wagwoord
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Maak seker jy kies iets wat jy definitief sal onthou.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordLabelText:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Voer ’n wagwoord in
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Invalid_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Jou wagwoordwenk kan nie jou wagwoord bevat nie.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHint_Empty_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: ’n Wenk word vereis. Maak seker dit help jou om jou wagwoord te onthou.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Great. Now. With an offline account, if you forget your password, the only way to retrieve it is with a hint, so make sure it's memorable.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintTitle:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Voeg ’n wenk vir jou wagwoord by
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintPlaceHolder:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Wagwoordwenk
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintLeadText:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Net in geval jy vergeet. Weereens: maak dit so onvergeetlik as wat jy kan.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: It's important that your password hint doesn't contain your password. That kind of defeats the purpose, really. Go ahead and pick another hint.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordEmpty_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Voer ’n wagwoord in.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirm_Error:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Hierdie wagwoord stem nie ooreen nie. Probeer dit weer tik.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: And one more time to make sure we've got it right…
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordConfirmTitle:
