  \errors\NoPinText:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Jy kan jou PIN terugstel deur te gaan na Instellings > Rekeninge > Aanmeldopsies.
  \errors\NoNetworkVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: You will need the Internet for this. It does not look like you are connected to the Internet. Check your connection and try again.
