  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Kortliks, ek is jou persoonlike assistent en vriend.<br/>Gereed wanneer jy is.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Hallo, ek is Cortana.<br/>Ek is hier om dinge makliker te maak en jou te help om dinge gedoen te kry.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Cortana is jou vriend, gereed om te help met enigiets wat jou super, dapper of net betyds hou.<br/><br/>Om Cortana in staat te stel om verpersoonlikte ervarings en relevante voorstelle te verskaf, versamel en gebruik Microsoft inligting insluitend jou ligging en liggingsgeskiedenis, kontakte, steminvoer, spraak- en handskrifpatrone, tikgeskiedenis, soekgeskiedenis, kalenderbesonderhede, inhoud en kommunikasiegeskiedenis van jou boodskappe en toepassings en ander inligting op jou toestel. In Microsoft Edge gebruik Cortana jou blaaigeskiedenis. Jy kan altyd verander aan wat Cortana onthou in die Notaboek en Cortana in Microsoft Edge deaktiveer.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Voer jou wagwoord in
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=AF-ZA: Vir sekuriteit, voer asseblief nog een keer jou wagwoord in.
